            <div class="vas-intro">
                <h2 class="title-cm text-center">WHAT IS VAS?</h2>
                <p class="mt50">
                    Voluntary Agreement Scheme on Energy Efficiency in Energy Intensive Industries (VAS Program) offers high-quality technical assistance to industrial enterprises to improve their energy efficiency. When participating in the VAS Program, enterprises benefit from the DEPP3 Program's provision of technical experts proficient in manufacturing processes across different industries/sub-sectors. These experts will assist businesses in executing high-quality energy audits and studying the feasibility of potential energy efficiency solutions so that enterprises can consider their investments.
                </p>
                <div class="text-center mt40">
                    <a href="introduction" class="btn-cm">More <i class="icon-next"></i></a>
                </div>
                <img src="/Content//img/info-img.png" alt="" class="mt40">
            </div>
        </div>
