    <div class="service container pt100 pb60" id="tech">
        <h2 class="title-cm text-center">TECHNICAL SUPPORT</h2>
        <div class="mt50 service-list">
            <div class="service-item">
                <div class="service-img maxheight">
                    <img src="/Content//img/service-01.jpg" alt="">
                </div>
                <div class="service-content maxheight">
                    <div>
                        <p class="service-name">Preparation</p>
                        <p class="mt20">To participate in the Voluntary Agreement Scheme, enterprises need to:</p>
                        <ul class="list-cm mt10">
                            <li>Submit a registration form to the Program.</li>
                            <li>Facilitate the local energy auditing firm and international consultants from the DEPP3 Program to conduct a preliminary survey at the enterprise premises.</li>
                            <li>Provide the necessary information to the local energy auditing firm to develop a technical proposal.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="service-item">
                <div class="service-img maxheight">
                    <img src="/Content//img/service-02.jpg" alt="">
                </div>
                <div class="service-content maxheight">
                    <div>
                        <p class="service-name">Signing the Agreement</p>
                        <p class="mt20">Signing the voluntary agreement with the Ministry of Industry and Trade </p>
                        <p class="mt20">Refer to the VA template <a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1iFbYcCmdLHBf77A53gHGTDYaP_u7-1QP/view" target="_blank" style="color:#fff">HERE</a></p>
                      
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="service-item">
                <div class="service-img maxheight">
                    <img src="/Content//img/service-03.jpg" alt="">
                </div>
                <div class="service-content maxheight">
                    <div>
                        <p class="service-name">Develop energy efficiency projects</p>
                        <p class="mt20">
                            Depending on the results of each activity, enterprises’ needs, and the Program’s resources, the Program will provide technical support for enterprises to implement separate or all the following initiatives:
                        </p>
                        <ul class="list-cm mt20">
                            <li>Conducting energy audits in comformity with international standards</li>
                            <li>Developing pre-feasibility studies</li>
                            <li>Developing feasibility studies</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="service-item">
                <div class="service-img maxheight">
                    <img src="/Content//img/service-04.jpg" alt="">
                </div>
                <div class="service-content maxheight">
                    <div>
                        <p class="service-name">Preparing loan application </p>
                        <p class="mt20">
                            Based on the results of the feasibility study and the enterprises’ interest, the DEPP3 Program may provide technical support for the enterprises in:
                        </p>
                        <ul class="list-cm mt20">
                            <li>Preparing loan applications </li>
                            <li>Connecting with suitable financial institutions.</li>
                            
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>


